## 🚀 CI/CD Integration

### GitHub Actions Example
```yaml
name: Test Suite

on: [push, pull_request]

jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '20'

      - name: Install dependencies
        run: npm ci

      - name: Run unit tests
        run: npm test

      - name: Run E2E tests
        run: npm run test:e2e

      - name: Security audit
        run: npm audit

      - name: Build
        run: npm run build

      - name: Lighthouse CI
        run: npm run lighthouse
```

