## 📈 Success Criteria

### Test Coverage Goals (HARD GATES - MUST PASS)
- **Unit Tests**: ≥ 80% code coverage (GATE: Build fails if < 80%)
- **Integration Tests**: 100% of critical flows covered (GATE: 15+ flows must pass)
- **E2E Tests**: Top 20 user journeys automated (GATE: All must pass to deploy)
- **API Tests**: 100% endpoint coverage (GATE: All endpoints tested)
- **Security**: Zero high/critical vulnerabilities (GATE: Blocks deployment)
- **Performance**: Lighthouse score ≥ 90 (GATE: Build fails if < 90)
- **Accessibility**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliant (GATE: axe violations = 0)

### Definition of Done (ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA)
- [ ] **Unit Tests**: ≥80% coverage, all tests passing
- [ ] **Integration Tests**: All 15 critical flows passing
- [ ] **E2E Tests**: All 20 user journeys passing (100% pass rate)
- [ ] **Security Scan**: npm audit shows 0 high/critical, OWASP ZAP clean
- [ ] **Performance**: Lighthouse ≥90 on all pages, p95 latency <200ms
- [ ] **Accessibility**: axe-core 0 violations, manual screen reader test passed
- [ ] **Load Test**: 10,000 concurrent users, <0.1% error rate, <200ms p95
- [ ] **Browser Test**: Manual test on Chrome, Firefox, Safari (latest 2 versions)
- [ ] **Regression**: All previous features still work (smoke test suite passes)

### CI/CD Gating Rules
```yaml
# Required CI checks (block merge/deploy if fail)
required_checks:
  - unit_tests: coverage >= 80%
  - integration_tests: pass_rate = 100%
  - e2e_tests: pass_rate = 100%
  - security_scan: high_vulns = 0, critical_vulns = 0
  - lighthouse: score >= 90
  - accessibility: axe_violations = 0
  - build: success

# Regression cadence
regression_tests:
  frequency: "After every PR merge"
  scope: "Full smoke test suite (30 min)"
  gate: "Blocks next deployment if fails"
```

